{{also|Asia|Ásia|asía|Asía|asĩa|Ասիա}}
==Finnish==
{{Finnish index|a|s}}

===Etymology===
Maybe from {{etyl|fiu-pro|fi}} {{term/t|fiu-pro|*ate}}, with cognates such as Estonian {{term|asi|lang=et}} and Hungarian {{term|izé|lang=hu}}. Compare with the Arabic word {{term|أشياء|lang=ar}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|[ˈɑsiɑ]|lang=fi}}
* {{hyphenation|a|si|a}}

===Noun===
{{fi-noun}}

# [[thing]], [[matter]], [[issue]], [[business]]
#: ''Kuuntele, mitä minulla on '''asiaa'''.''
#:: ''Please listen to the '''matter''' I have to talk to you about.''
#: ''Tämä ei ole sinun '''asiasi'''!''
#:: This is none of your '''business'''!

